  > source/errors/TimeoutError.ts::TimeoutError #6a03692d6c6a
  > source/errors/TimeoutError.ts::TimeoutError.constructor #3d06a554892b
#c7[overview,i5] Body shortcut methods enforce 2xx status codes, automatically throwing HTTPError with pre-parsed error data unless throwHttpErrors is disabled.
  > readme.md::"ky(input, options?)" #1c56f829d259
  > readme.md::throwHttpErrors #29b472f119e4
