#c69[i2] The getSupportedResponseTypes function checks whether Response.prototype.bytes is a function before exposing the 'bytes' response type.
  > source/core/constants.ts::getSupportedResponseTypes #3844f01957ab
#c70[i4] The stop symbol used to halt retries without throwing is registered globally via Symbol.for('ky.stop') across module instances.
  > source/core/constants.ts::stop #1379d433d6af
#c71[i3] Custom retry delays bypass jitter and backoffLimit to preserve exact server-specified delays.
