#c72[i4] RetryMarker uses a branded isRetryMarker getter property so markers from duplicate Ky installations are recognized across module boundaries.
  > source/core/constants.ts::RetryMarker.isRetryMarker #56c0862373c9
#c73[i4] Forced retries triggered by ky.retry() respect retry.limit but skip the shouldRetry check.
  > source/core/constants.ts:181 #ee4720aa4b59
#c74[i3] Ky re-reads onUploadProgress, onDownloadProgress, timeout, fetch, and throwHttpErrors on every retry attempt so beforeRetry hooks can modify them.
