#c79[i3] Two-digit years in RFC 850 dates map to the latest matching century not exceeding 50 years into the future.
  > source/core/retry-timing.ts::parseDate #1f28ded1c9c6
#c80[i3] createTimestamp round-trips parts against UTC date components to reject invalid overflow dates and handles leap seconds by adding 1000ms to second 59.
